𒑰 DUB.SAR 1.0 — Sequence Transformation (Canonical Cuneiform)
𒑰 Demonstrates iterating entries of a tablet and constructing a transformed sequence.

𒂊𒁹

    working raw_values of length 0
    raw_values 12 𒈭
    raw_values 24 𒈭
    raw_values 36 𒈭
    raw_values 48 𒈭

    working doubled of length 0
    total : 0

    consider entries of raw_values:
        doubled v 2 * 𒈭
        total : total + v

    doubled_len : doubled 𒁍
    final_entry : doubled last

𒅗𒁹

    total
    doubled_len
    final_entry
